{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the leader of an ancient Greek expedition, you set sail to explore unknown lands. Your mission includes not only discovering new territories but also conducting scientific research and defending against native tribes of ancient Europe and Africa. The gameplay focuses on tactical, turn-based battles where proper positioning and formation composition are key. You command a variety of soldiers with diverse skills and abilities that develop as you progress. Each mission requires a thoughtful strategy tailored to specific threats. After completing tasks, you repair your ship and resupply to continue your challenging journey. The game combines exploration, management, and combat, offering a fresh take on turn-based gameplay commanding a cohesive unit.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3929700?t=1769259287","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3929700?t=1769259287","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929700/2671082a51f1878a7f178bf6362fd89ed6c7284d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769259287","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929700/2671082a51f1878a7f178bf6362fd89ed6c7284d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769259287","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"